cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below.
type: software
title: RareBurden Commons
abstract: RareBurden Commons provides data-acquisition, provenance, semantic, evidence-ledger,
  burden-estimation, federated-analysis and release-assurance components for the Global
  Rare Disease Burden Initiative. Pre-v1 releases are research software and synthetic
  assurance infrastructure, not clinical decision-support tools or definitive global
  burden estimates.
authors:
- name: RareBurden Commons contributors
version: 0.3.0rc2
date-released: 2026-07-19
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
- burden of disease
- epidemiology
- federated analysis
- health economics
- provenance
- rare diseases
- reproducible research
